<slide xmlns="https://www.larkoffice.com/sml/2.0"><style><fill><fillColor color="rgb(250,245,240)"/></fill></style><data><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="34" width="864" height="52"><content textType="body" fontSize="30" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" wrap="false"><p>复盘：知识创造的六个动作</p></content></shape><table topLeftX="48" topLeftY="88" width="864" height="382"><colgroup><col width="140"/><col width="350"/><col width="374"/></colgroup><tr height="46"><td><fill><fillColor color="rgb(46,32,38)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(255,255,255)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p>动作</p></content></td><td><fill><fillColor color="rgb(46,32,38)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(255,255,255)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p>古诺做了什么</p></content></td><td><fill><fillColor color="rgb(46,32,38)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(255,255,255)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p>你可以怎样练习</p></content></td></tr><tr height="56"><td><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p>发现空白</p></content></td><td><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p>指出垄断与竞争之间的“少数几家”没有理论</p></content></td><td><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p>找到现有理论解释不了的中间地带</p></content></td></tr><tr height="56"><td><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p>设定假设</p></content></td><td><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p>同质品、选产量、对手产量给定</p></content></td><td><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p>写下假设，并说明为什么保留它</p></content></td></tr><tr height="56"><td><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p>形式推演</p></content></td><td><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p>利润最大化，求出反应函数与交点</p></content></td><td><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p>把假设变成可以求解的关系式</p></content></td></tr><tr height="56"><td><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p>对照定位</p></content></td><td><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p>与垄断、完全竞争的结果并排比较</p></content></td><td><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p>把新结果放进已知结论的坐标系</p></content></td></tr><tr height="56"><td><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p>接受批判</p></content></td><td><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p>伯特兰改选价格，得到悖论</p></content></td><td><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p>主动改一条假设，检验结论是否稳健</p></content></td></tr><tr height="56"><td><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p>推广一般化</p></content></td><td><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p>推广到 n 家，写成含参数的模型</p></content></td><td><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" paddingLeft="14"><p>把特例推广为一族模型</p></content></td></tr></table></data><note><content textType="body" fontSize="14"><p>这张表把整节课收拢起来：左边是动作，中间是古诺的做法，右边是学生在自己的练习里可以做的事。</p><p>六个动作可以迁移到其他模型：伯特兰、霍特林、斯塔克尔伯格，走的都是同一条路。</p><p>建议让学生用这张表自查课后的任务，看自己是不是每一步都做了。</p></content></note></slide>